{"id":1147120,"slug":"m-a-s-h-season-3-1974","title":"M*A*S*H- Season 3","title_en":null,"year":1974,"rating":92,"votes_count":594,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"série","vod_date":null,"plot":null,"poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/158/301/158301371_625412.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie","Drama","Válečný"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Larry Gelbart","Hy Averback","Don Weis","Gene Reynolds","Alan Alda","William K. Jurgensen","Lee Philips"],"actors":["Alan Alda","Wayne Rogers","McLean Stevenson","Loretta Swit","Larry Linville","Gary Burghoff","Harry Morgan","Jamie Farr","William Christopher","Lynnette Mettey","Teddy Wilson","Brad Trumbull","Kellye Nakahara","Todd Susman","Mako","Edward Winter","Jerry Fujikawa","Tad Horino","Jeff Maxwell","Loudon Wainwright III","James Gregory","Keene Curtis","Allan Arbus","Odessa Cleveland","Bobby Herbeck","Alex Karras","Mary Kay Place","Alice Faye","Joseph Stern","Basil Hoffman","William Watson","Curt Lowens","Dennis Troy","Michael O'Keefe","Titos Vandis","Louisa Moritz","Johnny Haymer","Bill Robinson","Shirley Temple","Robert Alda","Joseph Maher","Mary Wickes","Vincent Price","Gene Tierney","Cornel Wilde","Soon-Tek Oh","Dennis Dugan","Graham Jarvis","Jack Soo","Eldon Quick","Hilly Hicks","Stafford Repp","Ted Eccles","Shizuko Hoshi","Virginia Ann Lee","Patricia Marshall","Danil Torppe","Patricia Stevens","Richard Lee-Sung"],"screenwriters":["Laurence Marks","James Fritzell","Everett Greenbaum","Larry Gelbart","Linda Bloodworth-Thomason","Mary Kay Place","Robert Klane","Arthur Julian","Simon Muntner","John D. Hess","Sid Dorfman","John W. Regier","Gary Markowitz"],"cinematographers":["William K. Jurgensen","Joe Jackman"],"composers":["Benny Golson"],"reviews":[{"author":"niska98","text":"Třetí série mi pomohla přežít tentokrát začátek školního roku. Je to dost nadupaná série hláškami a kultovními epizodami (třeba Žebírka) a objeví se tu Harry Morgan a Robert Alda. Legendární Abyssinia, která v době vysílání vzbudila vlnu emocí (a asi oprávněně). A moje zjištění, že jsem tuhle epizodu kdysi už viděla.... Naposledy se setkáme i s Waynem Rogersem, který si podle mě zasloužil lepší rozloučení, ale situace byla taková, jaká byla.....(29.11.2025)","stars":5},{"author":"PunisherEDNA","text":"Třetí série představuje velký zlom – kvalita humoru, tempa i dramatických momentů dosahuje nové úrovně. Seriál si drží lehkost, ale mnohem odvážněji se pouští do kritiky války a do lidských příběhů. Epizody jako O.R., Adam’s Ribs nebo devastující finále Abyssinia, Henry ukazují, jak dokonale dokáže MAS*H střídat žánry a stále působit věrohodně. Chemie postav je nejsilnější v dosavadním běhu a závěr série patří k nejzásadnějším v historii televize. Jednoznačně jedna z nejlepších sezón celého seriálu.(15.11.2025)","stars":4},{"author":"sator","text":"Nádhera :-)(15.06.2020)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-ae94231d-0f04-482a-b9ee-9911e339e3ed"},{"platform":"prima+","url":"https://www.iprima.cz/serialy/m-a-s-h?utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=section_vod&utm_campaign=link_exchange"},{"platform":"Oneplay","url":"https://www.oneplay.cz/porad/16135-m-a-s-h"},{"platform":"Telly","url":"https://telly.cz/program/m-a-s-h/"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/primafamily:202607060bc51c7f0bb848683c10fabfd781a46e"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/m-a-s-h-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/68850-m-a-s-h/498900-season-3/prehled/","root_id":68850,"root_title_id":561001,"root_title":"M*A*S*H","root_slug":"m-a-s-h-1972","is_toplevel":false,"season_no":3,"episode_no":null}